{"id":"vod_sn_35959","vodId":"35959","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"架向星空之桥","name_cn":"架向星空之桥","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/78fc9b483ee9b946c35610448ce569ec.jpg"},"summary":"为了陪伴患有哮喘的弟弟星野歩（大桥步夕 配音）去乡间修养，星野一马（浅沼晋太郎 配音）毅然决然的放弃了学校的课程，来到了宁静祥和的山比古町。哪知道，刚刚到达没多久，就发生了让一马心跳加速的意外事件——自己和名叫中津川初（中村绘里子 配音）的陌生女孩子接吻了。虽然中津一副无所谓的样子，但从此，一马成为了她目光无法移开的焦点。　　在小镇里，住着各式各样性格单纯而又善良的人们。容易害羞的神社女巫神本圆佳（清水爱 配音），目睹了意外之吻的傲娇娘日向伊吹（青叶林檎 配音），成熟稳重的大姐姐藤堂䌷（高桥智秋 配音）等，在这些可爱女孩子的环绕下，一马能否坚守最初的约定？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qSzD344nYz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Svm9yDZ39q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mu4x4rSNKG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9GV1bLYU9P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fgi9v16suc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VEmspp1hG41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bLpHRjkPN41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/snzdnuCWwZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7YjRyda1nR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yKjNy2uYK91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UzK3SXRM511/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hyCJX76KAF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:28.841Z"}